# Roster Mate settings. Copy to .env and fill in real values.
# See docs/design.md "Configuration". Docker's --env-file does not allow inline comments.

# Required: the login.
APP_USERNAME=roster
APP_PASSWORD=change-me

# Required: roster extraction with Claude.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-replace-me
# Your name as printed on rosters, so Claude finds your row.
ROSTER_NAME=Your Name

# Optional: extraction model (default claude-sonnet-5-5).
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# Optional: HMAC key for session cookies. Leave empty to generate one and keep it in the database.
SESSION_SECRET=
# Optional: listen port (default 8080).
PORT=8080
# Optional: directory holding roster-mate.db (default /data). `make dev` uses DEV_DATA_DIR instead.
DATA_DIR=/data
# Optional: time zone for "today" in the extraction prompt (default: the container's, UTC).
TZ=Australia/Sydney
# Optional: Messages API address, an absolute http(s) URL (default: Anthropic's). Tests point it at the fake.
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:18081
# Optional: Resend API key. Set it to turn roster emails on; leave it empty for email off.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Required when RESEND_API_KEY is set: the roster email's From address, display name allowed.
# EMAIL_FROM=Your roster <roster@mail.example.com>
# Optional: Resend API address, an absolute http(s) URL (default https://api.resend.com). Tests point it at a fake.
# RESEND_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:18082
# Test only; never set in production. 1 mounts POST /api/test/reset, which deletes every shift, shift change, event, babysitter, recipient and roster email send.
# APP_TEST_MODE=1
